{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは～\n筒井あやめです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobSgD52M.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "年末どうお過ごしでしょうか？\n私は今年沢山お鍋をした気がします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年のツートップ鍋"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobOspVSw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "牡蠣～\n春菊初めてお鍋にいれたけどおいしいね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobqAh6iF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かに～   牡蠣も鱈もいれたよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな感じで冬を感じております"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年もとても楽しかったです\n新たな後輩ができ、先輩や同期の卒業があり、一つ一つを大切にしないとと改めて強く思った1年でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "個人としては写真集を発売できたり、ドラマに出させて頂けたり、充実していたなと思います\n来年もお芝居できたら嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんはどんな一年でしたか？\n私たちとの思い出も沢山ですか？\n今年もありがとうございました。\n来年もよろしくね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年も乃木坂46と皆さんと、いい一年になるように頑張るぞ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "の気持ちはまだ年始に置いておいて、\n今年も一年お疲れ様でした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よいお年をお迎えください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobycppQJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "筒井あやめでした"}], "source": "official"}